KONOHAGAKURE BINGO BOOK — MONITORED SUBJECT FILE

Name: Sasuke Uchiha
Village of Origin: Konohagakure
Current Status: Defected — left the village to pursue power under Orochimaru
Classification: Retrieval priority (NOT kill-authorized) — Hokage standing order

Background: Sole surviving loyal member of the Uchiha clan of the Leaf, younger brother of Itachi Uchiha. Genin of Team 7 under Kakashi Hatake. Bearer of the Sharingan and a cursed seal applied by Orochimaru during the Chunin Exams.

Known Abilities:
- Sharingan (maturing); Chidori and lightning-nature ninjutsu.
- Fire Release: Great Fireball Technique.
- Cursed Seal transformation (unstable).

Standing Order: Sasuke is to be returned alive to Konohagakure. He is not to be entered as a kill-bounty target. Any contact to be reported to Team 7 and the Hokage's Office. See prior retrieval operation records.
